	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With skill, or luck, or both, you fire with such accuracy you can shoot a projectile out of the air. As a reaction to someone making a ranged attack roll against you, fire a firearm against the target’s combat maneuver DC. On a success your attack negates theirs. On a critical success, you land a critical hit on the attacker. This maneuver has no effect on siege weapons, thrown boulders, or similarly sized projectiles.</p>",
